# Bot1 has Gray and Adira, a Grizzly Bear, and a land; Bot2 has its own Grizzly Bear. At combat the target choice refuses the
# opponent's creature and Bot1's land, then copies Bot1's Bear. Unsummon makes that token leave before the delayed sacrifice;
# its stale object ID must not cause the original Bear to be sacrificed (CR 603.7c, 400.7).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Island
Gray and Adira, Forever Joined
Grizzly Bears
Opt
Unsummon
Island
Island
Mox Emerald
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Grizzly Bears
Forest x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island#1.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Gray and Adira, Forever Joined.Cast(Spend: U, R)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Grizzly Bears.Cast
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Grizzly Bears.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest#1.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest#2.Activate
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Opt.Cast
[T5 Bot1.BeginCombat]
! Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears)
! Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Island#1)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears#2.Token = true
? Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears#2.Power = 2
? Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears#2.Toughness = 2
? Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears#2.Keywords = Haste
Bot1.Hand.Unsummon.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears#2)
Bot1.Battlefield.Island#1.Activate
[T6 Bot2.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Gray and Adira, Forever Joined#2 = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears.Power = 2
Bot2.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears.Power = 2
Bot1.Graveyard = Unsummon; Opt; Black Lotus
